# Hits: a routine whose straight-line top-level statements (before any if / case / loop /
# try / Exit) call the routine itself, bare or through Self.
# FP shapes (non-hits): recursion guarded by if/else, early Exit, recursion inside a loop,
# calls to a same-named method on ANOTHER object (delegation), overloaded names.
unconditional-recursion 20
unconditional-recursion 25
unconditional-recursion 30
!unconditional-recursion 39
!unconditional-recursion 47
!unconditional-recursion 53
!unconditional-recursion 64
!unconditional-recursion 73
